rduktan sonra şimdi makamı irşatta bir iltifat ile hıtabı âmmına bir lemeanı mahsus veriyor şöyle ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"459\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 458.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 24.0 24.0 30.7 37.6 37.6 46.6 46.6 62.3 62.3 71.3 71.3 87.0 87.0 87.0 96.0 96.0 107.3 114.0 120.7 120.7 132.7 139.6 155.3 162.0 162.0 168.7 175.6 183.7 183.7 190.6 206.3 206.3 215.3 215.3 222.0 222.0 228.7 228.7 240.0 257.3 257.3 264.0 264.0 264.0 270.7 278.3 285.0 285.0 300.7 311.3 319.6 319.6 327.0 327.0 333.7 333.7 345.7 361.6 379.6 379.6 386.3 406.6 420.0 431.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"62.3 114.0 132.7 139.6 175.6 190.6 240.0 300.7 345.7 361.6 386.3 442.6\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>","y":0}